{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The defect is in `CategoryServiceImpl.delete`: it explicitly deletes products when their last category is removed. I also found the missing-category lookup uses `getOne`/`getById` in a way that can return a lazy proxy instead of a scoped null, which explains the server error. I’m correcting both behaviors while retaining descendant deletion."}}
