{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The build passes. One lineage detail also needs tightening: category lineages already include the category’s own ID, so the existing descendant query appends that ID a second time and can miss children. I’m fixing the collection to use the stored lineage directly, ensuring the whole subtree’s product links are removed before the cascading category delete."}}
